		<footer class="border-t border-hairline px-5 py-8 sm:px-8">
			<div
				class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-body sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"
			>
				<p class="font-medium text-ink">NSDL Photo Resize</p>
				<p>
					Independent image utility. Not affiliated with Protean,
